    kind: work_item  # 1041
    title: "The self-proof never states its own scope: it covers the installed CLI and is silent about tests (conftest runs at collection), hooks, CI, and rust-analyzer executing a target's build.rs"  # 1041
    status: todo_hard  # 1041
    priority: 1  # 1041
    parent:  # 1041
    tags:  # 1041
